      "text": "VIP: 33-Day Grand Tour of South America – Peru, Bolivia and Chile"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:lead:e3456bc1f4d270f4",
      "field": "lead",
      "sourceTextSha256": "f62cc5d48b8579c89d2ea26a1c0c12739d878c8340a1dc41cbac078509588f34",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261110-tsvc722k5p",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "Over 33 days, you'll travel from the Peruvian Amazon to Chilean Patagonia. The route combines an Aqua Nera cruise and journeys on the Hiram Bingham and Belmond Andean Explorer trains with visits to Machu Picchu, the Uyuni Salt Flat, Easter Island and the Marble Caves. The itinerary includes a private flight over the Nazca Lines, a yacht trip to the Ballestas Islands and helicopter flights to Vinicunca and VIK Winery."
    },
